            0.588,
            0.419
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "5.1 How do we Measure?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.43,
            0.883,
            0.472
          ],
          "content": "Hardeep says, “I have seen my grandmother measuring cloth by the length of her arm.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.472,
            0.883,
            0.532
          ],
          "content": "“Have you ever seen how a farmer measures length to divide his field into beds? He walks and counts the number of his strides,” says Padma."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.533,
            0.882,
            0.573
          ],
          "content": "“Oh, not just the length of the strides—sometimes they also use the length of their feet to measure,” adds Anish."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.575,
            0.883,
            0.636
          ],
          "content": "Deepa says excitedly, “Measuring length using body parts must be so much fun! Let us also measure something using a body part.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.66,
            0.357,
            0.81
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.157,
                0.818,
                0.36,
                0.853
              ],
              "content": "Fig. 5.1: Use of handspan for measuring"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_image_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.379,
            0.635,
            0.883,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": "“What should we measure? Okay, let us measure the length of the table in our classroom,” says Tasneem."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.378,
            0.696,
            0.882,
            0.736
          ],
          "content": "Padma adds, “And which body part should we use to measure it?”"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.378,
            0.737,
            0.883,
            0.798
          ],
          "content": "Deepa says, “Let us use our handspan. I will show you how to use it (Fig. 5.1). I have seen my mother using it. She calls it balisht.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.379,
            0.799,
            0.882,
            0.839
          ],
          "content": "Hardeep adds, “Okay. Let us also note down our measurements. ”"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.089,
